#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:263
msgid "How do I get API credentials for this courier?"
msgstr "Как да получа API данни за достъп за този куриер?"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:269
msgid "You receive:"
msgstr "Получавате:"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:275
msgid ""
"A courier can change its process - if a step differs, follow the courier's "
"own instructions."
msgstr ""
"Куриерът може да промени процеса си - ако някоя стъпка се различава, "
"следвайте инструкциите на самия куриер."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:284
msgid ""
"Speedy issues API access to registered business clients - there is no "
"instant self-signup."
msgstr ""
"Speedy предоставя API достъп на регистрирани бизнес клиенти - няма "
"моментална самостоятелна регистрация."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:286
msgid "Have (or open) a Speedy business contract."
msgstr "Имайте (или сключете) бизнес договор със Speedy."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:287
msgid ""
"Request REST API access (ask for a test account first) from your Speedy "
"account manager, or via the integration contact on the Speedy \"System "
"integration\" page below."
msgstr ""
"Заявете достъп до REST API (първо поискайте тестов акаунт) от вашия мениджър"
" в Speedy или чрез контакта за интеграция на страницата \"Системна "
"интеграция\" на Speedy по-долу."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:288
msgid "Speedy issues an API username + password for api.speedy.bg."
msgstr "Speedy издава API потребителско име + парола за api.speedy.bg."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:289
msgid "Enter the username and password below, click Validate, then Sync."
msgstr ""
"Въведете потребителското име и паролата по-долу, натиснете \"Провери\", след"
" това \"Синхронизирай\"."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:291
msgid "API username + password"
msgstr "API потребителско име + парола"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:292
msgid "Speedy system integration:"
msgstr "Системна интеграция на Speedy:"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:297
msgid ""
"Econt's API uses your own e-Econt (\"Моят Еконт\") business account - there "
"is no separate API key."
msgstr ""
"API-то на Econt използва вашия собствен e-Econt (\"Моят Еконт\") бизнес "
"акаунт - няма отделен API ключ."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:299
msgid "Register or open a business account in \"Моят Еконт\" at ee.econt.com."
msgstr ""
"Регистрирайте или отворете бизнес акаунт в \"Моят Еконт\" на ee.econt.com."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:300
msgid "Confirm with Econt that API access is enabled for your account."
msgstr "Уверете се с Econt, че API достъпът е активиран за вашия акаунт."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:301
msgid ""
"Your API username is your account e-mail; the password is your account "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Вашето API потребителско име е имейлът на акаунта ви; паролата е паролата на"
" акаунта ви."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:302
msgid "Enter the e-mail and password below, click Validate, then Sync."
msgstr ""
"Въведете имейла и паролата по-долу, натиснете \"Провери\", след това "
"\"Синхронизирай\"."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:304
msgid "account e-mail (username) + password"
msgstr "имейл на акаунта (потребителско име) + парола"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:305
msgid "Моят Еконт:"
msgstr "Моят Еконт:"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:310
msgid ""
"Pigeon Express issues an API Key + Secret to business clients on request."
msgstr "Pigeon Express издава API ключ + секрет на бизнес клиенти при заявка."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:312
msgid ""
"Contact Pigeon Express and request API access (e-mail "
"support@pigeonexpress.com, or via pigeonexpress.com)."
msgstr ""
"Свържете се с Pigeon Express и заявете API достъп (имейл "
"support@pigeonexpress.com или чрез pigeonexpress.com)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:313
msgid ""
"They issue an API Key + API Secret (production; ask for a sandbox/test key "
"to test)."
msgstr ""
"Те издават API ключ + API секрет (за продукция; поискайте sandbox/тестов "
"ключ за тестване)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:314
msgid ""
"Ask them for your pickup office ID (the office you drop parcels off at)."
msgstr ""
"Поискайте от тях вашето ID на офис за приемане (офисът, в който предавате "
"пратките)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:315
msgid ""
"Enter the Key, Secret and pickup office below, click Validate, then Sync. "
"Tick \"Sandbox\" only for a test account."
msgstr ""
"Въведете ключа, секрета и офиса за приемане по-долу, натиснете \"Провери\", "
"след това \"Синхронизирай\". Отметнете \"Sandbox\" само за тестов акаунт."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:317
msgid "API Key + API Secret (+ your pickup office ID)"
msgstr "API ключ + API секрет (+ вашето ID на офис за приемане)"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:318
msgid "Pigeon API docs:"
msgstr "Документация на Pigeon API:"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:323
msgid "BOX NOW issues OAuth2 credentials through its integration team."
msgstr "BOX NOW издава OAuth2 данни за достъп чрез екипа си по интеграции."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:325
msgid ""
"E-mail integrationsupport@boxnow.bg with your company name, address, tax ID "
"(ЕИК), contact details, and the phone numbers of the people who will use the"
" Partner Portal (needed for OTP SMS login)."
msgstr ""
"Пишете на integrationsupport@boxnow.bg с името на фирмата, адрес, ЕИК, данни"
" за контакт и телефонните номера на хората, които ще използват Partner "
"Portal (нужни за OTP SMS вход)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:326
msgid ""
"They issue your OAuth2 Client ID + Client Secret and confirm your Warehouse "
"ID and Partner ID."
msgstr ""
"Те издават вашите OAuth2 Client ID + Client Secret и потвърждават вашите "
"Warehouse ID и Partner ID."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:327
msgid ""
"Enter the Client ID, Client Secret, Partner ID and Warehouse ID below; "
"choose the Production environment (or Stage for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Въведете Client ID, Client Secret, Partner ID и Warehouse ID по-долу; "
"изберете среда Production (или Stage за тестване)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:329
msgid "OAuth2 Client ID + Client Secret (+ Partner ID, Warehouse ID)"
msgstr "OAuth2 Client ID + Client Secret (+ Partner ID, Warehouse ID)"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:330
msgid "BOX NOW:"
msgstr "BOX NOW:"

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:335
msgid ""
"Sameday issues API credentials (username + password) to clients after a "
"business contract."
msgstr ""
"Sameday издава API данни за достъп (потребителско име + парола) на клиенти "
"след сключване на бизнес договор."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:337
msgid ""
"Sign a Sameday business contract (via sameday.bg or your Sameday account "
